    <briefdescription>
<para>Collection of DBG_VALUEs observed when traversing a block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Records each variable and the value the DBG_VALUE refers to. Requires the machine value location dataflow algorithm to have run already, so that values can be identified. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
